# infer: ranks and signs

Tests that use ranks or signs: the rank-sum, signed-rank and sign tests. Each page documents one function: its signature, what it computes, the parameters, the fields of the result, the errors, and examples with their output.

## The Surface

| Function | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`ranksum`](ranks_and_signs/ranksum.md) | Wilcoxon rank-sum (Mann–Whitney) test for two independent samples. |
| [`signrank`](ranks_and_signs/signrank.md) | Wilcoxon signed-rank test for a median or for paired differences. |
| [`signtest`](ranks_and_signs/signtest.md) | Sign test for a median or for paired differences. |

